---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Procurement Case Studies | HYWSource Supply Chain Solutions"
  description="Explore HYWSource procurement and supply chain case studies covering supplier development, Vietnam sourcing, China+1 strategy and supply chain risk management across Asia."
>

<main>

  <section class="hero">

    <div class="hero-image">
      <img
        src="/images/case-studies-factory.png"
        alt="Manufacturing factory production line in China"
      />
    </div>

   <div class="hero-content">

  <h1>
    Real sourcing projects, supplier challenges and supply chain solutions across Mainland China, Taiwan and Vietnam.
  </h1>

  <p>
    These case studies demonstrate how HYWSource supports international
    businesses through supplier evaluation, manufacturing coordination,
    product development and supply chain risk management across Mainland
    China, Taiwan and Vietnam.
  </p>

</div>

  </section>


  <section class="projects">

    <h2>
      Featured Projects
    </h2>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">

        <h3>
          Supplier Development & Product Development
        </h3>

        <p>
          Building reliable manufacturing partnerships through supplier
          qualification, product development support and production evaluation.
        </p>

        <a href="/case-study-supplier-development/">
          View Case Study →
        </a>

      </div>


      <div class="card">

        <h3>
          Vietnam Sourcing & China+1 Supply Chain Strategy
        </h3>

        <p>
          Evaluating alternative manufacturing opportunities through supplier
          research, factory assessment and manufacturing capability analysis
          in Vietnam.
        </p>

        <a href="/case-study-vietnam-sourcing/">
          View Case Study →
        </a>

      </div>


      <div class="card">

        <h3>
          Supply Chain Risk Management
        </h3>

        <p>
          Helping businesses improve supply chain resilience through proactive
          supplier management, risk identification and procurement strategy.
        </p>

        <a href="/case-study-supply-chain-risk-management/">
          View Case Study →
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="approach">

    <h2>
      Our Procurement Approach
    </h2>

    <p>
      Successful sourcing is not only about finding suppliers. It requires
      understanding manufacturing capabilities, evaluating risks and creating
      long-term partnerships between global businesses and reliable
      manufacturing partners.
    </p>

    <p>
      Learn more about our
      <a href="/services/">
        procurement and supply chain services
      </a>.
    </p>

    <ul>

      <li>
        Supplier research and qualification
      </li>

      <li>
        Factory capability evaluation
      </li>

      <li>
        Product development and production support
      </li>

      <li>
        Cost optimisation and negotiation
      </li>

      <li>
        Supply chain risk management
      </li>

    </ul>

  </section>


  <section class="cta">

    <h2>
      Let's discuss how HYWSource can support your procurement and supply chain
      requirements across Mainland China, Taiwan and Vietnam.
    </h2>

    <a href="/contact/">
      Contact HYWSource →
    </a>

  </section>

</main>


<style>

main {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 80px 40px 100px;
}


/* HERO */

.hero {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
  gap: 34px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 70px;
}


.hero-image {
  width: 100%;
  height: 545px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 10px;
}


.hero-image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
}


.hero-content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
}


.hero-content h1 {
  margin: 0 0 30px;
  font-size: 38px;
  line-height: 1.27;
  letter-spacing: -0.8px;
  color: #111;
}


.hero-content p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: #555;
}


/* FEATURED PROJECTS */

.projects h2 {
  font-size: 32px;
  line-height: 1.3;
  margin: 0 0 35px;
}


.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 30px;
}


.card {
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 10px;
}


.card h3 {
  margin-top: 0;
  font-size: 24px;
  line-height: 1.25;
}


.card p {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #555;
}


.card a {
  font-weight: bold;
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}


.card a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}


/* PROCUREMENT APPROACH */

.approach {
  margin-top: 80px;
  max-width: 900px;
}


.approach h2 {
  font-size: 32px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}


.approach p {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}


.approach a {
  font-weight: bold;
  color: inherit;
}


.approach li {
  margin: 15px 0;
  font-size: 18px;
}


/* CTA */

.cta {
  margin-top: 80px;
  padding: 50px;
  background: #111;
  color: white;
}


.cta h2 {
  margin-top: 0;
  font-size: 30px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}


.cta a {
  color: white;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-decoration: none;
}


.cta a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}


/* MOBILE */

@media (max-width: 900px) {

  main {
    padding: 60px 25px 80px;
  }


  .hero {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 35px;
  }


  .hero-image {
    height: 450px;
  }





  .hero-content h1 {
  font-size: 36px;
}


  .cards {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

}


@media (max-width: 600px) {

  .hero-image {
    height: 360px;
  }


  .hero-title h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
  }


  .hero-content p {
  font-size: 17px;
}


  .cta {
    padding: 35px 25px;
  }

}

</style>

</Layout>